Description:It is your first main phase. You control Slippery Bogle and Mist Leopard, and have Giant Growth in hand with one green mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter (no more than one creature can attack each combat). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-hexproof-own-target | Hexproof stops only the opponents' spells and abilities from targeting (CR 702.11b), while shroud stops everyone's (CR 702.18a): Giant Growth can target your own Slippery Bogle, which attacks as a 4/4; Mist Leopard cannot be pumped and deals only 3
